        <mxCell id="legend" value="Solid line = a request or data flow.&amp;nbsp; Orange = a call into the engine, by a rule's name.&amp;nbsp; Dashed purple = a Claude call, made by the planner with the Anthropic SDK (no agent framework).&amp;nbsp; Dashed grey = a hand-off outside the request path (the promoted model).&amp;nbsp; Dashed border = runs in-process, not as its own container.&amp;nbsp; Seven services: webapp, planning-service, db, airflow, pipeline-processing, pipeline-training, ml." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=11;fontColor=#666666;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="1080" width="1320" height="46" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
